/*
  QueueJobDrawer.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0020 · QueueJobDrawer (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `QueueJobDrawer`
  resolves (table "QueueJobDrawer") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are
  kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing
  the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/QueueJobDrawer.tsx). The second group is the per-status word catalog
  the web `t(\`queueStatus.jobStatus.${status}\`, status)` resolves (the `STATUS_TONE` keys, with
  any unmapped status falling back to its raw token at runtime). The third group backs the native
  chrome (P4 freshness / empty-title / error-retry / close + VoiceOver-only labels) so the Swift
  sources hold no English literals.
*/

